1.  **Emry, Lurker of the Loch (p9):** She has indeed entered the battlefield successfully. However, the system currently shows her as *tapped*. This is a critical detail, as creatures should not enter the battlefield tapped unless specifically stated by an ability or effect. She also has summoning sickness, as expected.\n\
