3.  **Milled Cards:** Emry's 'mill four' ability has resolved, depositing Pithing Needle (p29), Steam Vents (p30), Urza's Saga (p31), and another Urza's Saga (p32) into my graveyard. These are valuable additions for Emry's ability to cast artifacts from the graveyard.\n\
4.  **Mana:** My Mox Opal (p3) is currently untapped, and Fiery Islet (p12) is tapped.\n\
\n\
Given that Emry (p9) is currently tapped, I cannot activate her ability to cast an artifact from my graveyard this turn, as her activated ability requires tapping. My other current options are limited to Welding Jar, Claws of Gix, casting another Emry, Weapons Manufacturing or Kappa Cannoneer. I don't have mana for the latter two, and I don't want to play another Emry since I have one on the field and it would be Legendary Rule.\n\
\n\
I shall pass priority for now, and await my next turn to untap Emry and begin utilizing her archival retrieval capabilities.\"",
