      "reasoning": "\"Ah, it appears my esteemed Emry, Lurker of the Loch (p9) has exerted herself and is currently tapped, having just assisted in the retrieval of the Mox Opal. Her ability to delve into the archives is therefore temporarily unavailable.\n\
