    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Playing Urza's Saga instead of Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth means only one disruption spell can be cast this turn instead of potentially two. With Urborg providing a third black source, both Thoughtseize and Inquisition of Kozilek could be cast this turn to strip the opponent's hand. Urza's Saga could be played next turn instead.",
