    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to activate the existing Emry's tap ability before the second Emry resolves. With the legend rule, one Emry will be sacrificed. By tapping the old Emry now (targeting Mishra's Bauble or Mox Opal in graveyard), they could get value from both the old Emry's tap ability AND the new Emry's ETB mill trigger.",
