    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Opponent has Emry on the battlefield with a graveyard full of powerful artifacts (Engineered Explosives, Pithing Needle, Mox Opal, Mishra's Bauble, two Urza's Sagas). Emry's tap ability to recur these artifacts is the opponent's primary engine. Nihil Spellbomb would exile the entire graveyard, stranding Emry with no targets and removing the threat of recurring Engineered Explosives or other powerful artifacts. Pithing Needle naming Emry would also permanently shut down the engine. Shadowspear provides incremental combat advantage but doesn't address the main strategic threat.",
