      "better_line": "Play Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth (already on field - so play Ifnir Deadlands), cast Inquisition of Kozilek or Thoughtseize to strip the opponent's hand, then attack with Nethergoyf (3/4 with Sorcery/Land/Enchantment in graveyard). Even if Emry blocks, trading Emry for damage is excellent since Emry is their artifact recursion engine.",
      "type": "blunder",
