      "decision_index": 68,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem25F Libby passed their precombat main phase without casting anything despite having the mana and artifacts to cast Kappa Cannoneer. With Mox Opal (metalcraft active with 4 artifacts), Fiery Islet for mana, and the ability to tap artifacts for Improvise (Welding Jar, Claws of Gix, Pithing Needle, Mox Opal), Kappa Cannoneer costs 5U but with Improvise tapping 4 artifacts only needs U + 1 more mana. Fiery Islet produces U, Mox Opal produces another mana = 2 mana + 4 improvised artifacts = 6 total, exactly enough to cast Kappa Cannoneer. Kappa Cannoneer would enter as a 5/5 (gets a counter on ETB), can't be blocked the turn it enters, has ward 4, and would represent a massive threat against an opponent at 17 life with only a tapped Nethergoyf as a creature. Alternatively, casting Weapons Manufacturing first (1R via Fiery Islet + Mox Opal) would set up powerful synergies with artifacts entering. Passing with a full hand and available mana is a significant missed opportunity.",
      "action_taken": "Passed the precombat main phase without casting any spells.",
