      "decision_index": 78,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Playing Prismatic Vista instead of Ifnir Deadlands means Sonnet Coach cannot cast Thought-Knot Seer this turn. Ifnir Deadlands naturally produces {C}, and with Urborg already in play, it also taps for {B}. Playing Ifnir Deadlands would give exactly {3}{B} + {1}{C} = enough to cast Thought-Knot Seer (cost {3}{C}), providing both hand disruption AND a 4/4 body. Instead, they're limited to just Thoughtseize or Inquisition this turn.",
