      "description": "Chose to target Mox Opal with Emry's ability, but there's already a Mox Opal on the battlefield. Due to the legend rule, casting a second would just replace the existing one with no net benefit. Mishra's Bauble would be free to cast, draws a card next upkeep, and adds an extra artifact to the board (helping cast Kappa Cannoneer via improvise). Engineered Explosives could also answer Shadowspear or other threats.",
